WEBVTT

00:00:07.280 --> 00:00:10.000
<b>Binan High School Sakashita</b>

00:00:08.160 --> 00:00:10.600
The other guys sure are late!

00:00:10.600 --> 00:00:12.990
What's with his outfit?

00:00:13.270 --> 00:00:15.700
Makes it hard to shout, "Sorry 
for the wait!" and run up to him.

00:00:15.700 --> 00:00:18.710
He's a grade schooler. A grade schooler 
who can't wait to get to the ocean.

00:00:18.710 --> 00:00:22.680
Actually, you can't ride a train 
without a shirt on, can you?

00:00:22.680 --> 00:00:24.570
It's criminal indecent exposure.

00:00:24.570 --> 00:00:26.930
We don't have a choice. Let's get him dressed.

00:00:28.920 --> 00:00:30.690
You're late, senpai!

00:00:30.690 --> 00:00:32.480
No, we've been here a while.

00:00:32.480 --> 00:00:34.890
We just didn't have the 
courage to call out to you.

00:00:35.330 --> 00:00:36.930
Anyway, put something on.

00:00:37.410 --> 00:00:39.200
By the way, where's Wombat?

00:00:39.200 --> 00:00:42.100
My, my! Sorry for the wait, everyone!

00:00:42.100 --> 00:00:43.860
Oh, he's here.

00:00:43.860 --> 00:00:44.780
Wom-san!

00:00:44.780 --> 00:00:47.160
Even in this heat, you want to handle him?

00:00:47.570 --> 00:00:50.530
The urge to cuddle isn't restricted by the season!

00:00:51.040 --> 00:00:52.790
That sounds rough.

00:02:26.180 --> 00:02:31.880
Love, Training Camp, and Toothbrushes

00:02:34.840 --> 00:02:37.800
So good! Kakinotane are so good!

00:02:38.040 --> 00:02:41.770
It's been hot every day. 
Will Mr. Tawarayama be okay?

00:02:41.770 --> 00:02:43.770
Of course, that's why I brought him.

00:02:44.530 --> 00:02:45.910
The FX again?

00:02:45.910 --> 00:02:49.970
No, I'm checking out an online lodging service.

00:02:49.970 --> 00:02:53.010
You should be able to get a discount 
if you register your email address.

00:02:53.010 --> 00:02:54.200
That's our Io.

00:02:54.760 --> 00:02:56.270
Remind me.

00:02:56.270 --> 00:02:59.810
Why did we end up going to a training
camp in this terrible heat, again?

00:03:00.430 --> 00:03:01.910
Hey, come on.

00:03:03.670 --> 00:03:06.180
Active Summer 
Travel!

00:03:04.530 --> 00:03:07.620
Hey. Let's go to the ocean.

00:03:07.620 --> 00:03:09.510
Ocean!

00:03:10.230 --> 00:03:12.670
Oh, really? I proposed it?

00:03:12.980 --> 00:03:15.310
What's wrong with a training camp?

00:03:15.310 --> 00:03:16.850
It's the ocean! The ocean!

00:03:16.850 --> 00:03:18.360
There'll be a hot spring there, too.

00:03:18.360 --> 00:03:20.260
No female presence, though.

00:03:20.710 --> 00:03:22.980
The peasants do love their trains, don't they?

00:03:22.980 --> 00:03:24.810
But a limousine is so much more luxurious.

00:03:24.810 --> 00:03:28.520
I think they take trains because they don't 
have limousines, not because they like it.

00:03:28.520 --> 00:03:29.500
Really?

00:03:29.500 --> 00:03:33.500
But I still don't like traveling by train.

00:03:33.500 --> 00:03:34.780
What about you, President?

00:03:34.780 --> 00:03:37.310
I have no objection to traveling by train.

00:03:37.870 --> 00:03:40.430
However, it should at least be chartered.

00:03:40.430 --> 00:03:41.720
That's right.

00:03:41.720 --> 00:03:43.490
Would you like some special selection Kakinotane?

00:03:44.640 --> 00:03:45.960
I would.

00:03:46.610 --> 00:03:48.880
Ocean!

00:03:49.340 --> 00:03:50.920
It's the ocean! The ocean!

00:03:50.920 --> 00:03:53.320
We know. You don't have to shout.

00:03:53.320 --> 00:03:57.690
Well, you've got the blinding 
sun and the white sand, but...

00:03:57.690 --> 00:03:59.640
Is it just my imagination,
or is something a bit odd?

00:04:03.720 --> 00:04:05.890
It's all dudes.

00:04:05.890 --> 00:04:08.730
You're right. Why is it all men here?

00:04:08.730 --> 00:04:11.260
Is this actually "that kind of place"?

00:04:11.260 --> 00:04:12.960
What's "that kind of place"?

00:04:12.960 --> 00:04:15.890
Hey, Atsushi. You're the one 
who chose this place, right?

00:04:15.890 --> 00:04:17.010
You were?

00:04:17.010 --> 00:04:18.580
Well, see...

00:04:19.110 --> 00:04:23.970
Let's see. Danran Beach... Danran Beach...

00:04:23.970 --> 00:04:26.960
"Danran" as in "happy family" Beach...

00:04:26.960 --> 00:04:29.000
I was sure it was in this area...

00:04:27.540 --> 00:04:29.000
Hey, buddy!

00:04:29.000 --> 00:04:31.160
Are you looking for a beach?

00:04:31.160 --> 00:04:32.280
Uh, yeah.

00:04:32.800 --> 00:04:35.420
Let me show you!

00:04:36.560 --> 00:04:38.960
Th-Thank you...

00:04:38.960 --> 00:04:41.880
<b>Welcome to Danran (Wild Man) Beach</b>

00:04:40.360 --> 00:04:41.880
It was the wrong Danran...

00:04:42.180 --> 00:04:43.220
Be aware of this stuff.

00:04:43.220 --> 00:04:44.080
Sorry.

00:04:44.080 --> 00:04:46.510
The name by itself sounds very family-oriented.

00:04:46.510 --> 00:04:49.350
No wonder it lacks in female presence.

00:04:49.350 --> 00:04:52.420
So? What's wrong with this place?

00:04:52.420 --> 00:04:54.350
There's not too many people, 
and the ocean is beautiful!

00:04:54.350 --> 00:04:57.030
My first trip to the ocean!

00:04:57.490 --> 00:05:01.360
It's a wonderful beach, isn't it?

00:05:15.720 --> 00:05:18.020
Ocean!

00:05:17.090 --> 00:05:20.680
This would be the perfect resort, 
if not for all that vulgar noise.

00:05:21.500 --> 00:05:22.590
It's a shame, isn't it?

00:05:23.550 --> 00:05:25.370
Clear the mind of mundane thoughts,

00:05:25.370 --> 00:05:27.590
and you can block out even the basest of noises.

00:05:28.030 --> 00:05:29.710
That's our Kinshiro.

00:05:29.710 --> 00:05:31.840
You're strict with yourself even at a resort, eh?

00:05:31.840 --> 00:05:34.780
<b> Ice               Beach Shop       Danran    Takoyaki, Yakisoba, Frankfurters</b>

00:05:37.750 --> 00:05:40.490
Hey, buddy, you sure can put 
'em down! Wanna try for another?

00:05:40.490 --> 00:05:41.640
Let's go! Let's go!

00:05:41.640 --> 00:05:43.750
And another for my wombat!

00:05:43.750 --> 00:05:45.330
Squeak! Squeak!

00:05:45.330 --> 00:05:47.400
So cute!

00:05:47.400 --> 00:05:49.350
I want to cuddle him, too...

00:05:49.350 --> 00:05:50.940
Hello there.

00:05:51.470 --> 00:05:55.920
Well, cutie pie, have you decided on your order?

00:05:55.920 --> 00:05:59.310
Wow! You're so cool, Miss...

00:05:59.310 --> 00:06:00.690
Umm... Mister?

00:06:00.690 --> 00:06:02.630
"Miss" is just fine.

00:06:02.630 --> 00:06:05.880
Got it! Then I'll have a rainbow frappé, Miss!

00:06:06.130 --> 00:06:07.530
And is that all?

00:06:07.530 --> 00:06:08.410
Yeah!

00:06:08.410 --> 00:06:12.130
We've got many far more amazing things.

00:06:12.130 --> 00:06:13.560
Far more amazing.

00:06:13.560 --> 00:06:14.560
Really?!

00:06:15.110 --> 00:06:17.360
Is it okay to leave them like that?

00:06:18.830 --> 00:06:22.890
My instincts are telling me 
not to go near that place.

00:06:22.890 --> 00:06:25.170
En-chan, I think you could fit right in.

00:06:25.170 --> 00:06:28.450
You can make a favorable impression by 
offering things at below market value.

00:06:28.450 --> 00:06:30.320
Anyway, are you guys hungry?

00:06:30.320 --> 00:06:32.690
Yeah. Let's go to the inn.

00:06:33.540 --> 00:06:35.460
<b>Inn
Tamakuro Bath</b>

00:06:35.460 --> 00:06:36.950
Tamakuro Bath?

00:06:36.950 --> 00:06:38.790
I'm getting an incredible sense of déjà vu.

00:06:38.790 --> 00:06:41.220
Yeah. It looks just like the Kurotama Bath!

00:06:41.720 --> 00:06:44.410
This was the only place 
with vacancies this weekend.

00:06:44.410 --> 00:06:46.000
This doesn't feel fresh at all.

00:06:46.000 --> 00:06:47.390
Are they cutting corners?

00:06:47.390 --> 00:06:48.990
Don't say that!

00:06:51.110 --> 00:06:53.380
Well, shall we get going?

00:06:56.100 --> 00:06:57.690
Sleepover!

00:06:57.690 --> 00:07:00.020
We owe you for a night's stay and a meal!

00:07:00.610 --> 00:07:01.720
Not bad, eh?

00:07:01.720 --> 00:07:03.880
But isn't it a bit small for all of us?

00:07:03.880 --> 00:07:06.460
No. We'll only be sleeping here, 
so it should be fine.

00:07:06.460 --> 00:07:07.240
Yeah.

00:07:12.030 --> 00:07:13.690
Not bad, I'd say.

00:07:13.690 --> 00:07:16.610
I'm sorry it's so small. 
It's the only room they had left.

00:07:16.920 --> 00:07:18.990
We each have our own bedroom, right?

00:07:18.990 --> 00:07:19.840
Of course.

00:07:19.840 --> 00:07:21.580
Then there's no problem!

00:07:21.580 --> 00:07:23.130
<b>Men</b>

00:07:21.580 --> 00:07:23.130
<b>Large 
Bath</b>

00:07:23.420 --> 00:07:25.600
Nothing new here, either.

00:07:25.600 --> 00:07:27.950
In fact, it's exactly what we always do.

00:07:27.950 --> 00:07:29.940
Doesn't feel like we've traveled at all.

00:07:29.940 --> 00:07:30.930
Sorry.

00:07:31.190 --> 00:07:32.960
It's not your fault, Atsushi.

00:07:32.960 --> 00:07:34.620
This actually makes it more relaxing.

00:07:34.620 --> 00:07:36.760
Isn't it funny how similar it looks?

00:07:36.760 --> 00:07:38.450
There may even be other similarities.

00:07:38.450 --> 00:07:40.600
If I open this door...

00:07:40.600 --> 00:07:42.410
Maybe my brother Goro will be there!

00:07:42.410 --> 00:07:43.660
No way.

00:07:43.660 --> 00:07:44.360
There!

00:07:45.150 --> 00:07:46.310
Wow!

00:07:46.310 --> 00:07:47.960
An open-air bath!

00:07:47.960 --> 00:07:49.240
What?!

00:07:50.130 --> 00:07:51.760
An unexpected development.

00:07:51.760 --> 00:07:52.790
Want to check it out?

00:07:52.790 --> 00:07:53.780
Of course.

00:07:54.480 --> 00:07:55.920
This is nice!

00:07:55.920 --> 00:07:58.140
They should have a sign out for this.

00:08:01.780 --> 00:08:02.620
Everyone!

00:08:03.840 --> 00:08:04.840
There's been an incident.

00:08:04.840 --> 00:08:06.130
A murder?!

00:08:06.130 --> 00:08:08.890
Now, now. This isn't Detective C*nan.

00:08:08.890 --> 00:08:09.830
I guess...

00:08:09.830 --> 00:08:12.220
Someone has used my toothbrush!

00:08:14.290 --> 00:08:15.190
Toothbrush?

00:08:15.540 --> 00:08:16.690
Yes.

00:08:16.690 --> 00:08:18.130
My toothbrush!

00:08:26.690 --> 00:08:27.990
This is a criminal act.

00:08:29.350 --> 00:08:31.490
It can be called nothing but a criminal act!

00:08:32.960 --> 00:08:34.760
This was no mistake.

00:08:34.760 --> 00:08:37.910
Someone used my toothbrush on purpose!

00:08:37.910 --> 00:08:40.680
No, no, it was probably just a mistake.

00:08:40.680 --> 00:08:42.740
That's right. You're overthinking it, Io.

00:08:42.740 --> 00:08:43.880
Are you sure?

00:08:44.440 --> 00:08:46.340
If any of you were in my position right now,

00:08:46.340 --> 00:08:49.720
you would be able to understand this 
unparalleled feeling of discomfort!

00:08:50.240 --> 00:08:52.190
Try to imagine it.

00:08:52.190 --> 00:08:55.180
Someone has intentionally used your toothbrush.

00:08:55.180 --> 00:08:57.200
What's more, they didn't even wash it afterwards.

00:08:57.200 --> 00:09:00.810
They treated it coarsely, as if they wanted 
the victim to discover the signs of its use!

00:09:01.380 --> 00:09:02.770
I probably wouldn't like that.

00:09:02.770 --> 00:09:04.440
Yeah, I wouldn't like it.

00:09:04.440 --> 00:09:06.280
There are only men here, after all.

00:09:06.280 --> 00:09:08.240
It wasn't me!

00:09:08.240 --> 00:09:10.690
What's with the sudden flag?

00:09:10.690 --> 00:09:12.970
I'm merely telling the truth.

00:09:12.970 --> 00:09:17.440
First of all, I'd never do such a monstrous 
thing with Mr. Tawarayama right here.

00:09:17.440 --> 00:09:19.410
But you're just controlling him, aren't you?

00:09:19.410 --> 00:09:21.490
I am absolutely not being controlled.

00:09:21.490 --> 00:09:22.640
You're a corpse.

00:09:22.640 --> 00:09:24.910
I told you, he's not dead yet!

00:09:24.910 --> 00:09:27.290
I use an electric frog toothbrush!

00:09:27.290 --> 00:09:29.590
Are you people trying to change the subject?

00:09:29.940 --> 00:09:31.850
I haven't brushed my teeth yet.

00:09:31.850 --> 00:09:32.960
Same.

00:09:32.960 --> 00:09:33.790
Me, either.

00:09:34.280 --> 00:09:35.710
Very well.

00:09:35.710 --> 00:09:39.180
Then, everyone face me and go, "Hah!"

00:09:39.180 --> 00:09:40.270
"Hah!"

00:09:40.700 --> 00:09:41.850
Hah?

00:09:41.850 --> 00:09:43.730
If you've brushed your teeth,

00:09:43.730 --> 00:09:46.520
there should still be the faint scent 
of toothpaste on your breath!

00:09:46.520 --> 00:09:47.950
That makes sense.

00:09:47.950 --> 00:09:51.810
But why do you care so much if 
a toothbrush or two gets used?

00:09:51.810 --> 00:09:53.520
I agree!

00:09:53.520 --> 00:09:56.360
But don't you see why 
Io would feel conflicted?

00:09:56.360 --> 00:09:58.740
Someone used his toothbrush on purpose.

00:09:58.740 --> 00:10:00.740
It's like getting tricked into an indirect kiss.

00:10:00.740 --> 00:10:05.290
Oh, that's like when you secretly play 
the recorder of someone you like, right?

00:10:05.290 --> 00:10:07.160
Yes. That's exactly it.

00:10:07.600 --> 00:10:09.460
That really would be rough.

00:10:09.460 --> 00:10:11.310
It is very rough!

00:10:11.310 --> 00:10:14.370
Especially if the criminal 
turns out to be one of us here!

00:10:17.200 --> 00:10:18.530
Really?

00:10:18.530 --> 00:10:20.390
I wouldn't care that much, personally.

00:10:21.000 --> 00:10:22.660
Yufuin-senpai.

00:10:22.660 --> 00:10:25.220
I've noticed that all this time,

00:10:25.220 --> 00:10:29.390
you've been trying to shrug this 
problem off as much as possible.

00:10:29.680 --> 00:10:32.860
Are you afraid of something 
coming out if you're questioned?

00:10:33.750 --> 00:10:36.830
Huh? Hey, what's with this vibe?

00:10:37.280 --> 00:10:40.210
You're acting like I secretly used Naruko's toothbrush

00:10:40.210 --> 00:10:42.420
and now I'm over the moon about it or something.

00:10:42.420 --> 00:10:44.630
It's not unthinkable.

00:10:45.540 --> 00:10:48.580
My observations tell me that you're a person

00:10:48.580 --> 00:10:52.510
who could be classified as a 
loose individual in many respects.

00:10:53.500 --> 00:10:55.680
Particularly in regard to morality.

00:10:55.680 --> 00:10:58.130
Hey, now. This is getting weird.

00:10:58.130 --> 00:11:01.080
Of course, if En-chan could be called gray,

00:11:01.080 --> 00:11:02.930
Ryuu isn't exactly pure white, either.

00:11:03.300 --> 00:11:04.100
Me?

00:11:04.430 --> 00:11:06.930
Ryuu, you claim to love women,

00:11:06.930 --> 00:11:09.980
but I've never actually seen 
you with a woman before.

00:11:09.980 --> 00:11:12.360
Let's be honest. You like Io, right?

00:11:12.360 --> 00:11:13.450
Gross!

00:11:13.450 --> 00:11:15.740
It's gross when you put it that way.

00:11:15.740 --> 00:11:20.010
I consider Io my buddy, so he's, I mean...

00:11:20.010 --> 00:11:21.570
It's not that kind of...

00:11:21.570 --> 00:11:24.470
Ryuu... Was it you?

00:11:25.970 --> 00:11:27.170
Io...

00:11:27.840 --> 00:11:30.500
Okay, this really is getting weird!

00:11:30.500 --> 00:11:31.960
Do something, Yumoto!

00:11:32.350 --> 00:11:35.720
I don't see why it matters 
whose toothbrush you use!

00:11:35.720 --> 00:11:38.020
Stop passing the conversation to Yumoto.

00:11:38.020 --> 00:11:39.340
We're getting off topic!

00:11:39.340 --> 00:11:40.130
Sorry.

00:11:40.440 --> 00:11:46.180
Anyway, the question is, can we assume 
that someone among us has eyes for Io?

00:11:46.180 --> 00:11:50.150
You can sum it up like that, 
but you're a suspect, too, Atsushi.

00:11:51.110 --> 00:11:52.330
That's true.

00:11:52.330 --> 00:11:55.570
Kinugawa-senpai, I've seen you 
look at Io in a rather odd way before.

00:11:55.570 --> 00:11:57.160
No, no, no, no...

00:12:00.800 --> 00:12:03.910
I'm pruning. Can we get out now?

00:12:04.840 --> 00:12:06.070
Good idea.

00:12:08.280 --> 00:12:10.540
They're rather close... the futons.

00:12:10.540 --> 00:12:11.650
Yeah.

00:12:11.650 --> 00:12:15.330
I don't know about sleeping this close 
to you guys under these circumstances...

00:12:15.330 --> 00:12:18.050
Why are you acting like a victim here?

00:12:18.050 --> 00:12:21.920
Yufuin-senpai, Kinugawa-senpai, 
you're both incredibly gray individuals.

00:12:21.920 --> 00:12:23.220
That's right.

00:12:24.690 --> 00:12:27.110
But we can't sleep yet, huh?

00:12:27.110 --> 00:12:28.930
We should keep having fun!

00:12:28.930 --> 00:12:31.010
Like a pillow fight, or a test of courage!

00:12:31.010 --> 00:12:32.920
It's a training camp! We've gotta do it!

00:12:32.920 --> 00:12:34.570
You really are a grade schooler.

00:12:34.570 --> 00:12:38.360
It amazes me that you can think about 
having fun in these circumstances.

00:12:39.370 --> 00:12:41.620
Well, shall we start with the test of courage?

00:12:42.010 --> 00:12:45.040
We didn't even have a 
conversation, let alone a debate.

00:12:46.010 --> 00:12:47.200
Yeah.

00:12:48.110 --> 00:12:50.500
Pass through the forest next to the inn.

00:12:50.500 --> 00:12:53.840
That lit-up tree is the goal!

00:12:54.550 --> 00:12:58.470
Everyone, do you have your map 
and flashlights from the inn?

00:12:58.470 --> 00:13:00.000
Yes.

00:13:00.260 --> 00:13:02.390
We're really doing this, huh?

00:13:02.390 --> 00:13:03.960
We've got lights, after all.

00:13:03.960 --> 00:13:07.500
Well, I don't think I could sleep with 
that weird feeling hanging over us anyway.

00:13:07.500 --> 00:13:08.980
I absolutely can't sleep.

00:13:08.980 --> 00:13:12.360
Not until I find the culprit 
who used my toothbrush.

00:13:12.360 --> 00:13:14.180
But when you think about it,

00:13:14.180 --> 00:13:16.690
should we have a test of courage 
in these circumstances?

00:13:17.030 --> 00:13:18.450
What do you mean?

00:13:18.450 --> 00:13:20.850
Well, it happens a lot, you know?

00:13:28.640 --> 00:13:30.160
That kind of thing.

00:13:30.160 --> 00:13:31.230
I see.

00:13:31.230 --> 00:13:33.330
I'm not gonna hug anyone!

00:13:33.330 --> 00:13:35.080
Okay, let's get started!

00:13:35.080 --> 00:13:36.830
Listen to what we're saying here!

00:13:36.830 --> 00:13:39.210
Saying that to Yumoto won't do any good.

00:13:39.210 --> 00:13:40.050
True.

00:13:45.040 --> 00:13:46.420
The beachside this afternoon...

00:13:47.090 --> 00:13:49.430
Is there really nothing we can do about it?

00:13:49.860 --> 00:13:51.800
If it bothers you that much,

00:13:51.800 --> 00:13:55.300
shall I talk to the owners and 
buy up the surrounding beaches?

00:13:55.300 --> 00:13:56.900
Strong words, those are.

00:13:57.700 --> 00:14:00.210
Shall we get out of the 
bath and have some tea?

00:14:04.040 --> 00:14:05.730
It's pitch black, huh?

00:14:05.730 --> 00:14:07.920
Atsushi. You're too close.

00:14:08.520 --> 00:14:10.240
Sorry. I just got scared.

00:14:10.240 --> 00:14:13.710
<i>So he says, but I bet he got close on purpose.</i>

00:14:13.710 --> 00:14:16.920
<i>Is En-chan being overly aware of my presence?</i>

00:14:18.890 --> 00:14:20.100
Wh-What?!

00:14:20.100 --> 00:14:22.080
Sorry, I tripped over a rock.

00:14:23.610 --> 00:14:25.910
Hey, Atsushi, are you eating properly?

00:14:26.510 --> 00:14:28.300
Your waist is really thin.

00:14:28.300 --> 00:14:30.460
<i>My waist is thin?</i>

00:14:30.460 --> 00:14:32.260
<i>En-chan, you really are...</i>

00:14:32.260 --> 00:14:33.860
<i>Crap...</i>

00:14:33.860 --> 00:14:36.730
<i>I totally should not have said that...</i>

00:14:41.350 --> 00:14:43.440
Woah, scary.

00:14:43.440 --> 00:14:45.160
It really does feel like a ghost will show up.

00:14:45.160 --> 00:14:47.500
Living people are far scarier.

00:14:47.500 --> 00:14:49.170
They do things like using people's toothbrushes.

00:14:49.170 --> 00:14:50.820
Yeah, but still...

00:14:50.820 --> 00:14:53.960
I really don't handle this kind of thing well.

00:14:53.960 --> 00:14:56.500
<i>He's sticking so close to me...</i>

00:14:56.500 --> 00:14:59.120
<i>Is Ryuu's womanizing just camouflage, after all?</i>

00:15:00.500 --> 00:15:03.260
<i>If only I were with a cute girl here...</i>

00:15:03.260 --> 00:15:05.840
<i>But then I'd want her doing this to me...</i>

00:15:08.500 --> 00:15:11.260
Hey, I know. You want to try taking a shortcut?

00:15:11.800 --> 00:15:15.470
Huh? Kinshiro? Akoya?

00:15:15.480 --> 00:15:17.570
<b>Private Property
Keep Out 
-Danran Resort</b>

00:15:21.300 --> 00:15:22.770
Feels good!

00:15:23.280 --> 00:15:26.960
The cuddles that you have regardless of 
who might be watching are so amazing.

00:15:28.370 --> 00:15:31.730
Th-That was awful... You beast!

00:15:31.730 --> 00:15:33.620
I cuddle when I want to!

00:15:33.940 --> 00:15:36.500
That's the condition for joining 
the Battle Lovers, isn't it?

00:15:36.500 --> 00:15:38.290
I never agreed to that.

00:15:38.290 --> 00:15:39.580
Now, let's go!

00:15:39.880 --> 00:15:41.680
How self-serving you are...

00:15:48.770 --> 00:15:50.180
He's gone.

00:15:50.650 --> 00:15:53.170
Hey! Where are you?

00:15:53.170 --> 00:15:54.900
I'm gonna leave you behind!

00:15:55.680 --> 00:15:57.350
Could it be...

00:15:57.620 --> 00:15:59.510
that I'm lost?

00:15:59.510 --> 00:16:01.560
Arima will make fun of me...

00:16:03.730 --> 00:16:06.440
I've been careless.

00:16:06.440 --> 00:16:08.230
How could I fall behind the other two?

00:16:11.960 --> 00:16:13.960
I must have lost consciousness...

00:16:14.980 --> 00:16:17.620
M-Mr. Tawarayama?!

00:16:18.210 --> 00:16:19.580
Where did you go?!

00:16:20.050 --> 00:16:23.250
Where am I? And in a yukata, at that?

00:16:23.250 --> 00:16:27.050
I'm sure I was just preparing tests at school...

00:16:27.550 --> 00:16:30.320
Huh? I thought I saw a flash.

00:16:30.320 --> 00:16:32.010
Probably a camera.

00:16:32.010 --> 00:16:34.020
I had my suspicions about him.

00:16:34.880 --> 00:16:35.920
Who?

00:16:36.170 --> 00:16:38.240
The toothbrush incident, this development...

00:16:38.240 --> 00:16:39.930
It's all seemed too odd to me.

00:16:40.280 --> 00:16:43.660
It's true that this sort of thing 
would never happen normally.

00:16:43.660 --> 00:16:45.020
Which means...

00:16:45.020 --> 00:16:46.340
Wombat...

00:16:46.340 --> 00:16:47.900
Let's take him to task.

00:16:51.050 --> 00:16:53.920
What's going on?!

00:16:57.920 --> 00:17:00.450
Wh-Why is this happening?

00:17:01.520 --> 00:17:02.850
Did you hear something?

00:17:02.850 --> 00:17:04.400
Behind us, right?

00:17:04.400 --> 00:17:05.290
Yes.

00:17:05.290 --> 00:17:06.550
A m-molester?

00:17:06.550 --> 00:17:08.050
Why would you think that?

00:17:08.050 --> 00:17:11.110
Well, there was that "unique" beach back there...

00:17:11.110 --> 00:17:13.540
And we're pretty hot guys, you know?

00:17:13.540 --> 00:17:16.490
Well, I suppose if I had to classify us,
we'd be on the hot side.

00:17:16.490 --> 00:17:17.740
Right?

00:17:17.740 --> 00:17:20.470
So it must have been the molester 
who used your toothbrush.

00:17:21.170 --> 00:17:24.150
It's obvious that no one in our group
would do something like that!

00:17:24.910 --> 00:17:26.060
You have a point.

00:17:26.060 --> 00:17:28.090
Let's catch him and take him to task!

00:17:28.090 --> 00:17:29.070
Good idea.

00:17:29.450 --> 00:17:32.190
Was I dead, perhaps?

00:17:32.190 --> 00:17:35.570
My body feels rather numb, 
there's not much feeling...

00:17:36.800 --> 00:17:40.250
S-Someone save me!

00:17:44.890 --> 00:17:47.910
Okay, on three.

00:17:47.910 --> 00:17:48.630
Yeah.

00:17:51.340 --> 00:17:54.280
Okay, on three.

00:17:54.280 --> 00:17:55.020
Right.

00:17:55.420 --> 00:17:56.970
One, two...

00:17:56.970 --> 00:17:57.970
Three!

00:18:06.900 --> 00:18:08.530
Did you catch the molester?

00:18:11.200 --> 00:18:12.440
Why are you guys here?

00:18:12.440 --> 00:18:14.450
Who are you calling a molester?

00:18:15.550 --> 00:18:16.870
And you're heavy!

00:18:17.390 --> 00:18:18.830
Mr. President.

00:18:19.190 --> 00:18:21.320
You smell nice. Fresh out of the bath?

00:18:22.430 --> 00:18:24.150
Remove yourself from me at once!

00:18:24.150 --> 00:18:25.280
Sure, sorry.

00:18:28.380 --> 00:18:29.700
You okay?

00:18:32.420 --> 00:18:34.920
Aside from an extreme feeling of discomfort.

00:18:37.540 --> 00:18:38.640
Can you stand?

00:18:39.750 --> 00:18:41.050
I'm fine.

00:18:42.850 --> 00:18:44.020
There's a leaf stuck on you.

00:18:45.840 --> 00:18:47.770
Why are you turning red?

00:18:47.770 --> 00:18:48.990
Sh-Shut up!

00:18:49.270 --> 00:18:51.480
What are you doing here?

00:18:51.480 --> 00:18:53.810
What are <i>you</i> all doing here?

00:18:53.810 --> 00:18:55.670
Defense Club training camp.

00:18:55.670 --> 00:18:57.380
I wasn't asking you!

00:18:57.380 --> 00:18:58.450
Huh?

00:18:58.450 --> 00:19:00.090
What's all this?

00:19:00.090 --> 00:19:01.620
What are you all doing here together?

00:19:01.620 --> 00:19:03.620
Never mind. It's all meaningless.

00:19:03.620 --> 00:19:05.270
I don't want to think about it.

00:19:05.270 --> 00:19:06.620
I'm erasing it from my memory.

00:19:07.490 --> 00:19:10.080
Hey, President, wait for us!

00:19:10.690 --> 00:19:12.540
I have no idea what's going on, but bye!

00:19:12.870 --> 00:19:14.780
What are they doing here?

00:19:14.780 --> 00:19:16.020
It's a mystery.

00:19:16.620 --> 00:19:19.390
There was a weird vibe to those guys, too.

00:19:20.010 --> 00:19:22.240
Everyone's taking so long!

00:19:22.240 --> 00:19:24.180
Even Wom-san ran away.

00:19:24.460 --> 00:19:26.220
Nothing to do.

00:19:26.220 --> 00:19:28.690
I really do suspect Wombat, though.

00:19:28.690 --> 00:19:30.110
He's an alien, after all.

00:19:30.350 --> 00:19:32.350
I'm still pushing the molester theory.

00:19:32.350 --> 00:19:33.410
Rejected.

00:19:33.410 --> 00:19:34.870
Huh?

00:19:35.240 --> 00:19:37.280
I've been waiting forever!

00:19:37.280 --> 00:19:38.630
Sorry, sorry.

00:19:38.630 --> 00:19:40.190
A lot of things happened.

00:19:43.960 --> 00:19:45.740
Are those my students?

00:19:46.210 --> 00:19:47.200
Hey!

00:19:55.220 --> 00:19:56.290
A monster!

00:19:57.010 --> 00:19:58.720
Let's Love Making!

00:20:00.830 --> 00:20:03.310
We are the heirs to the throne of love!

00:20:03.310 --> 00:20:04.770
Battle Lovers!

00:20:05.580 --> 00:20:07.260
Feel the power...

00:20:07.520 --> 00:20:09.130
Of love!

00:20:10.390 --> 00:20:12.400
Take this, monster!

00:20:25.170 --> 00:20:27.620
No! Don't do that!

00:20:27.620 --> 00:20:31.000
Love Attack!

00:20:38.860 --> 00:20:41.440
What's going on?!

00:20:49.940 --> 00:20:52.140
Huh? Mr. Tawarayama?

00:20:52.140 --> 00:20:54.240
So it wasn't a monster?

00:20:54.240 --> 00:20:56.560
I guess Tawarayama was the monster.

00:20:56.560 --> 00:20:59.470
To be honest, it was so dark, 
I couldn't really see...

00:20:59.470 --> 00:21:01.610
We kinda got carried away there.

00:21:01.610 --> 00:21:03.530
Tawarayama-san! Are you okay?

00:21:03.530 --> 00:21:06.060
It's fine. He was dead already anyway.

00:21:06.060 --> 00:21:07.490
Was this your doing?

00:21:08.490 --> 00:21:10.720
If you're going to scare us,
at least do it properly.

00:21:10.720 --> 00:21:11.480
Um...

00:21:11.480 --> 00:21:13.380
Say "boo" or something.

00:21:13.380 --> 00:21:15.170
That's too old-fashioned.

00:21:15.520 --> 00:21:17.420
It was just one example!

00:21:17.930 --> 00:21:21.340
I'm so sleepy. Let's go home.

00:21:21.340 --> 00:21:23.550
You're the one who wanted 
to do the test of courage!

00:21:23.550 --> 00:21:25.180
Well, let's go back anyway.

00:21:25.180 --> 00:21:26.180
Yeah.

00:21:26.180 --> 00:21:30.640
More importantly, I want to know 
who used my toothbrush!

00:21:30.960 --> 00:21:32.340
You're still stuck on that?

00:21:32.340 --> 00:21:33.740
Let's go, Yumoto.

00:21:33.740 --> 00:21:34.730
Okay...

00:21:34.730 --> 00:21:37.900
I will not sleep until we resolve 
the matter of my toothbrush!

00:21:37.900 --> 00:21:40.050
Um... Everyone...

00:21:40.050 --> 00:21:43.740
Please help me... Please...

00:21:49.970 --> 00:21:54.080
<b>Earth Defense Club                          (lol)</b>

00:21:50.730 --> 00:21:53.790
They're a bit blurry from the camera shaking...

00:21:53.790 --> 00:21:58.120
But it's nice to gain new memories like this.

00:21:58.120 --> 00:22:00.980
Though things got a bit hairy at the end there.

00:22:02.660 --> 00:22:04.330
Th-This is...

00:22:06.070 --> 00:22:08.110
<b>Delete this photo? 
Yes | No</b>

00:23:40.560 --> 00:23:41.700
"Friendship!"

00:23:41.980 --> 00:23:45.280
There is nothing more 
transient and fragile than this.

00:23:45.280 --> 00:23:48.500
Now, let us sever the bonds between people,

00:23:48.500 --> 00:23:51.620
and plunge the world into despair!

00:23:51.620 --> 00:23:53.470
Next time: Love Wanders!

00:23:51.620 --> 00:23:54.850
Next Time

00:23:51.620 --> 00:23:54.850
Love Wanders!

00:23:53.470 --> 00:23:54.850
Conquest!
